  "content_md": "Aneesh has joined the blygging revolution\n\n![[534ypbq54rt882nqmss2nfnzg8]]\n\n",
  "content_html": "<p>Aneesh has joined the blygging revolution</p>\n\n<blockquote class=\"blyg-transclusion\" data-blyg-id=\"534ypbq54rt882nqmss2nfnzg8\" data-blyg-version=\"1\" data-blyg-origin=\"https://blyg.aneeshsathe.com/\">\n<p>And my first stub-back!</p>\n<p>Back-stubbing would be a fun thing to come into parlance 😄</p>\n\n<blockquote class=\"blyg-transclusion\" data-blyg-id=\"1zrpk185yr9wt7cbnwq4c9mg9j\" data-blyg-version=\"2\" data-blyg-origin=\"https://jd-blyg.exe.xyz/\">\n<blockquote class=\"blyg-transclusion\" data-blyg-id=\"0c6gjtnyg4qmrs5nvha0gar2vb\" data-blyg-version=\"1\" data-blyg-origin=\"https://blyg.aneeshsathe.com/\">\n<p>Hello blyg world!!</p>\n\n</blockquote>\n<p><em>tap tap tap</em> is this thing on? you're my first stub, Aneesh 🥇\n<span class=\"blyg-tk-gen\">![[7k2wq9fbz3mxdnp5rt8hyj4cve]]\n_context, since &quot;stub&quot; is doing a lot of work here: this is what the screen looked like before — that little ghosted row at the bottom is the affordance, sitting there empty, waiting for someone to be the first_</span></p>\n\n</blockquote>\n\n</blockquote>\n",
